  },
  "@id": "foafnaut",
  "@type": "App",
  "position": 36,
  "id": "foafnaut",
  "family": "media",
  "icon": "🧭",
  "name": "foafnaut",
  "surface": "window",
  "url": "https://danbri.github.io/factoidal/web/hub/foafnaut/",
  "desc": "The foafnaut web browser, in a window",
  "capabilities": [],
  "external": true,
  "persists": false,
  "notes": [
    "The foafnaut browser from danbri/factoidal-core, at its deployed Hub page. It stays in the Factoidal repo; this row only points at it.",
    "It runs in the ordinary sandbox, with no same-origin capability. A worker cannot start from an opaque origin, so its browser loop runs on the page thread, and heavy pages can hold up its window.",
    "Links meant for the system browser show as text, because the sandbox has no allow-popups.",
    "Pages provides Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *, which the opaque-origin frame needs for its modules and data."
  ]
}
